OL,3,T///,/,-.,./,,-,-,-.-.,-.,/-.-.,.,.,,///
OL,4,CBurnham tells young people EU deal 'is 
OL,5,Cfor you' as Badenoch criticises it as  
OL,6,Cunfair                                 
OL,7,GThe UK and EU agree a new deal         
OL,8,Gcovering food exports, youth mobility  
OL,9,Gand carbon emissions - but talks on    
OL,10,Gstudent tuition fees will continue.    
OL,12,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham calls it a 
OL,13,F"historic moment", saying people in    
OL,14,Fthe UK want a "better deal" with the   
OL,15,FEU than the "hard Brexit we ended up   
OL,16,Fwith"; President of the European       
OL,17,FCommission Ursula von der Leyen says   
OL,18,Fit's a "big success".                  
OL,22,                                   G1/3 
OL,23,D]CHeadlinesG101CNewsreelG152CSportG300 
