OL,3,T///,/,-.,./,,-,-,-.-.,-.,/-.-.,.,.,,///
OL,4,CBurnham tells young people EU deal 'is 
OL,5,Cfor you' as Badenoch criticises it as  
OL,6,Cunfair                                 
OL,7,FUniversity groups warn any reduction   
OL,8,Fin EU student fees could put pressure  
OL,9,Fon UK student places and take more     
OL,10,Fmoney out of UK higher education.      
OL,12,FFrom Brussels, our political editor    
OL,13,FChris Mason writes.                    
OL,22,                                   G3/3 
